{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>TinyWin Camera 是一款以視覺方式記錄習慣的相片追蹤工具，核心儀式十分簡單：每天拍下一張進度照。無論是書桌佈置、健身變化、創作歷程、詞彙截圖，還是長達數月的挑戰，都能用它留下完整軌跡。此 App 原價 US $3.99，現正限時免費，適合希望養成每日習慣、並且想親眼看見變化過程的使用者。</p>\n\n<h2>視覺化習慣追蹤與里程碑</h2>\n<p>拍攝時會同時顯示昨日相片，方便對齊角度；完成後可一鍵裁切成正方形，套用鮮明、單色或暖調濾鏡，並加上日期浮水印與簡短筆記。習慣可設定每日、每週或自訂頻率，休息日不會中斷連續紀錄。目標完成後可將相片匯出成 MP4 縮時影片，並以年度熱力圖回顧成果。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/320x480bb-9.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/320x480bb-10.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/320x480bb-11.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/320x480bb-12.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/320x480bb-13.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/320x480bb-14.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：TinyWin Camera</li>\n<li>應用類別：Lifestyle</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-06T22:59:35.559960+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":335,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}